  m_Name: DOC_1924_SoKhoaHon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KhoaHon.Notebook.DocumentData
  id: DOC_1924_SoKhoaHon
  title: "S\u1ED5 Kh\xF3a H\u1ED3n \u2014 t\u1EADp 1"
  year: 1
  body: "Ng\u0169 H\xE0nh Kh\xF3a H\u1ED3n. L\u1EA5y n\u0103m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\xE2n
    c\u1EADn l\xE0m M\u1EAFt Tr\u1EADn, m\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF m\u1ED9t
    h\xE0nh: M\u1ED9c, Th\u1EE7y, Th\u1ED5, Kim, H\u1ECFa. L\u1EA5y t\xE1m phu h\u1ED3
    ch\xF4n s\u1ED1ng trong v\xE1ch l\xE0m m\u1EA1ch d\u1EABn kh\xED. M\u01B0\u1EDDi
    ba h\u1ED3n kh\xF3a v\xE0o \u1EA4n \u0110\u1ED3ng, k\u1EBB gi\u1EEF \u1EA4n h\u01B0\u1EDFng
    ph\xFAc l\u1ED9c kh\xF4ng c\xF9ng. N\u0103m \u0111\xE0i sen l\xE0 n\u0103m c\u1EEDa
    c\u1EE7a tr\u1EADn. Tr\u1EADn m\u1EDF th\xEC c\u1EEDa h\u1EA7m m\u1EDF.\n\n(K\xE8m
    s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 n\u0103m \u0111\xE0i sen.)"
  serif: 1
  flagOnRead: 0
